posts.body:
I think you can modify that method (save as .js file and add as a plugin) to always return false
Window_ItemList.prototype.needsNumber = function() {
if (this._category === "keyItem") {
return $dataSystem.optKeyItemsNumber;
} else {
return true;
}
};

Globally for every item?
Make a new plugin file with any name and paste this:
JavaScript:
/*:
 * @target MZ
 */

Window_ItemList.prototype.needsNumber = function() {
    return false;
}
